  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "ConfigurationTyped.preservation universally quantifies before/after and an actual Step with classes.erase. It concludes the same ConfigurationTyped judgment for the arbitrary successor. Step is the public collected relation, so the claim includes GC, not just RawStep. The inspected RawStep.preserves proof transfers roots on calls, discards residual callee roots only after delivery, and invokes collect_typed; Shared Realizes.collect_pending preserves surviving views and ownership after discarding roots. The prose makes no termination or destructor claim.",
  "limitations": [
    "Author self-review, not an independent review. Proof correctness is checked separately by Lean; the correspondence review compares statements, definitions and example propositions.",
    "Abstract syntax and mathematical GC are modeled; no parser or executable collector is certified. Functions safety permits divergence."
